{% block content %}{% raw %}
<section class="page-hero gl-hero" data-screen-label="Galerie — hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>La Thaïlande, en images</h1>
    <p>Temples, îles, marchés et points de vue, photographiés en chemin. Un avant-goût de ce qui t'attend.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad gl-main">
  <div class="container">
    <section class="gl-chapter" aria-labelledby="gl-nord">
      <h2 id="gl-nord">Le Nord</h2>
      <div class="gl-grid">
        <div class="g-item gl-t" data-lightbox data-src="/images/IMG_5227.jpg"><img eleventy:formats="avif,webp" fetchpriority="high" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 700px) 50vw, 90vw" src="/images/IMG_5227.jpg" alt="Anaïs devant un chedi doré"></div>
        <div class="g-item gl-t" data-lightbox data-src="/images/temple-blanc.jpg"><img eleventy:formats="avif,webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 700px) 50vw, 90vw" src="/images/temple-blanc.jpg" alt="Temple blanc aux sculptures ciselées"></div>
        <div class="g-item gl-t" data-lightbox data-src="/images/galerie/statue-blanche.jpg"><img eleventy:formats="avif,webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 700px) 50vw, 90vw" src="/images/galerie/statue-blanche.jpg" alt="Grande statue blanche sous un ciel bleu"></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="gl-chapter" aria-labelledby="gl-bangkok">
      <h2 id="gl-bangkok">Bangkok</h2>
      <div class="gl-grid">
        <div class="g-item gl-big" data-lightbox data-src="/images/galerie/canal-bouddha.jpg"><img eleventy:formats="avif,webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 66vw, (min-width: 700px) 50vw, 90vw" src="/images/galerie/canal-bouddha.jpg" alt="Canal bordé d'un stupa blanc et d'un grand bouddha doré"></div>
        <div class="g-item gl-t" data-lightbox data-src="/images/galerie/bangkok-chinatown.jpg"><img eleventy:formats="avif,webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 700px) 50vw, 90vw" src="/images/galerie/bangkok-chinatown.jpg" alt="Bangkok la nuit, enseignes de Chinatown"></div>
        <div class="g-item gl-t" data-lightbox data-src="/images/galerie/bangkok-rooftop.jpg"><img eleventy:formats="avif,webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 700px) 50vw, 90vw" src="/images/galerie/bangkok-rooftop.jpg" alt="Bangkok et le fleuve depuis un rooftop"></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="gl-chapter" aria-labelledby="gl-andaman">
      <h2 id="gl-andaman">La côte d'Andaman</h2>
      <div class="gl-grid">
        <div class="g-item gl-f" data-lightbox data-src="/images/IMG_2016.jpg"><img eleventy:formats="avif,webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 100vw, (min-width: 700px) 50vw, 90vw" src="/images/IMG_2016.jpg" alt="Coucher de soleil sur la plage"></div>
        <div class="g-item gl-w" data-lightbox data-src="/images/galerie/railay-eau-claire.jpg"><img eleventy:formats="avif,webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 66vw, (min-width: 700px) 50vw, 90vw" src="/images/galerie/railay-eau-claire.jpg" alt="Eau transparente au pied d'une falaise"></div>
        <div class="g-item gl-t" data-lightbox data-src="/images/galerie/phang-nga.jpg"><img eleventy:formats="avif,webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 700px) 50vw, 90vw" src="/images/galerie/phang-nga.jpg" alt="Point de vue sur une baie et ses pitons"></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="gl-chapter" aria-labelledby="gl-golfe">
      <h2 id="gl-golfe">Le golfe de Thaïlande</h2>
      <div class="gl-grid">
        <div class="g-item gl-t" data-lightbox data-src="/images/FullSizeRender.jpg"><img eleventy:formats="avif,webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 700px) 50vw, 90vw" src="/images/FullSizeRender.jpg" alt="Point de vue sur la jungle de Koh Samui"></div>
        <div class="g-item gl-w" data-lightbox data-src="/images/IMG_6424.jpg"><img eleventy:formats="avif,webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 66vw, (min-width: 700px) 50vw, 90vw" src="/images/IMG_6424.jpg" alt="Îles d'Ang Thong"></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band section-pad cta-full">
  <div class="ph-bg"><img sizes="(max-width: 899px) 150vw, 100vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/lac-longtail.jpg" alt="Eau turquoise au pied des montagnes, depuis un long-tail"></div>
  <div class="ph-overlay"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Et si la prochaine photo était la tienne ?</h2>
    <p>Raconte-moi ton projet : je compose l'itinéraire qui te mènera vers ces paysages — et bien d'autres.</p>
    <div class="btns">
      <a class="btn btn-white btn-lg" href="/contact/" data-magnetic><span>Recevoir mon devis gratuit <svg class="arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endraw %}{% endblock %}

{% block scripts %}{% raw %}
<script>ZWALD.init({ page: "galerie" });</script>
{% endraw %}{% endblock %}
